WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
- So Shannon, I have to ask you,

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.760
what are some of the small gestures

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.450
that have made a big
difference in your journey

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:07.300
that somebody has done
that people didn't realize

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.360
that might've been small to them,

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.990
but it really mattered to you.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.200
- I think the people sharing their own

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.190
cancer journeys on my Instagram.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.050
- Yeah.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.840
- Did a lot for me. I, you know,

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:20.154
like maybe I did for you,

00:00:20.154 --> 00:00:20.987
- Absolutely.

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:24.130
- It was the people sharing it from me

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:27.500
because it was, it was
people going through it

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.070
who had gone through it,

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:31.610
sort of letting me know that
they were there for me saying,

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:33.780
Hey, you know, like I posted a photo of

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.800
during chemo and I got really sick

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.790
and I had to get rushed and get IV and,

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:39.320
you know, hydrated and everything else.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.080
And they were like, listen,
we've been through this.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:42.970
You're going to be fine.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:43.880
You're going to get through this.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:47.200
So I think all that sort of
strength and that support

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.530
really, really helped me.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:50.940
And again, it goes back to like, yes,

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.480
Social Media can be a beautiful,
beautiful, beautiful thing

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.313
- Yeah.

00:00:54.313 --> 00:00:56.430
- if used the right if used the right way.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.430
- That beautiful connection. Absolutely.

